      "message": "I\u0027m not quite sure what you\u0027re asking.\n\nIf you\u0027re asking why SourcePath depends on Config.srcDir at all I don\u0027t know. I traced it back and it is the first argument passed to cmd.soong_build.main. So, it is possible this could be something other than \".\"\n\nIf you\u0027re asking why I have added the field to SourcePath it is simply to maintain functionality.",
