      "writtenOn": "2021-03-25T14:24:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I traced it back, too! The way this works is that the command line of soong_build is synthesized here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/blueprint/bootstrap/bootstrap.go?l\u003d147\u0026rcl\u003d21ed91031a83188ca958d491f030759490b0bbf7\n\n${in} is Args[0], which comes from here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/blueprint/bootstrap/bootstrap.go?l\u003d771\u0026rcl\u003d21ed91031a83188ca958d491f030759490b0bbf7\n\nwhich comes from $srcDir and Config.topLevelBlueprintsFile:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/blueprint/bootstrap/bootstrap.go?l\u003d748\u0026rcl\u003debdebb4fb3cc52561bf687b92d5115b3a9cc74ac\n\nConfig.topLevelBlueprintsFile is itself set here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/blueprint/bootstrap/command.go?l\u003d159\u0026rcl\u003d21ed91031a83188ca958d491f030759490b0bbf7\n\nThen here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/soong/ui/build/soong.go?l\u003d100\u0026rcl\u003d21ed91031a83188ca958d491f030759490b0bbf7\n\nto a constant \"Android.bp\"\n\n$srcDir comes from here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/blueprint/bootstrap/config.go?l\u003d42\u0026rcl\u003debdebb4fb3cc52561bf687b92d5115b3a9cc74ac\n\nand c.srcDir is set here:\n\nhttp://cs/android/build/soong/ui/build/soong.go?l\u003d75\u0026rcl\u003debdebb4fb3cc52561bf687b92d5115b3a9cc74ac\n\nto \".\"\n\nso Args[0] will be \"./Android.bp\" and Dir(Args[0]) will just be \".\" .\n\nIn the light of this, it doesn\u0027t look very useful to plumb a constant value even further, so just remove it?",
